["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"87. 对李想的3小时访谈（播客版）：宅男、AI、家庭、游戏和天梯 VLA VLM MPI BLM DT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-01-02-zhangxiaojun-李想-汽车是物理世界ai最大的应用-但l4门票要三样东西/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpb3_zjOH9-spT_U40JfWWyclsaR.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:53:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0102</span></div>\n<h2>李想：汽车是物理世界AI最大的应用，但L4门票要三样东西</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他把AI产品分三段：增强能力、成为助手、成为家人。今天连第一段都没做好，所以真正的竞争还没开始。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI产品</span><span class=\"tag\">智能驾驶</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"86. 大模型季报年终特辑：和广密预言LLM产品超越Google之路 Long Horizon Task MCP Data Wall Reward Model K-Lab\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-12-22-zhangxiaojun-下一个google不是搜索-是任务引擎/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrTCeUlQ09gFzkdnWKjlykF8u4sD.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:32:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1222</span></div>\n<h2>下一个Google不是搜索，是任务引擎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">ChatGPT、Anthropic、Perplexity 形态各异，但都在争夺同一件事：重新组织信息与任务。搜索和推荐融合成任务引擎，谁掌握 context 谁就赢。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"85. 与总统竞选成员聊，总统候选人与美国叙事如何PMF？ Product Market Fit Voter Registration Early Voting Tracker Deregulation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-12-15-zhangxiaojun-总统大选就是给候选人找-pmf-产品不行谁也救不了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1644e0aa04895839-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">52:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1215</span></div>\n<h2>总统大选就是给候选人找 PMF，产品不行谁也救不了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大选团队是短期内 scale up 最快的组织，但产品（候选人）已经定了，能做的只是把产品和整个国家的环境做 product market fit。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国大选</span><span class=\"tag\">PMF</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"84. 融了近4亿的AI创业者在干嘛？岂凡超的第一次访谈 conditioned generation RAG PMF MVP Foundation Model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-12-10-zhangxiaojun-模型公司终将消失-产品公司才刚开始/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpeVcobqnbak3XVOu7BfXTUxRjF4.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:44:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1210</span></div>\n<h2>模型公司终将消失，产品公司才刚开始</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">齐帆超认为模型本身没法直接产生价值，将来不存在模型公司；他融了近4亿却主动放弃训更大模型，转而解决大模型输出不确定性这个产品落地的最大卡点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI应用</span><span class=\"tag\">创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"83. 黄仁勋和3万亿美元英伟达是如何炼成的？ CUDA Riva 128 pilot in charge Top5\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-12-04-zhangxiaojun-英伟达没有二号位-黄仁勋退休后谁来管60个人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnQ0d4e307Y8Lg3G6QMvE8BumhZF.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:44:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1204</span></div>\n<h2>英伟达没有二号位：黄仁勋退休后谁来管60个人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英伟达的战略不是规划出来的，是三个团队两个赛季、运送一整头牛这些战术被验证后固定下来的；但公司至今没有明显的二号位。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">黄仁勋</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"82. 和以太坊Vitalik Buterin聊：LLM的权力、技术哲学观与猫 Layer 2 Farcaster Warpcast Polymarket Worldcoin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-11-25-zhangxiaojun-ai-是中心化的权力-crypto-是它的解药/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c8ee10748c810b71-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1125</span></div>\n<h2>AI 是中心化的权力，Crypto 是它的解药</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Vitalik 说 AI 的权力来自算力和数据，最好的 AI 就是最大的 AI，天然走向中心化；Crypto 唯一的作用是解决人和人之间的信任问题，所以 AI 参与 Crypto 的游戏，而不是反过来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI</span><span class=\"tag\">Crypto</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"81. 和李开复聊聊：如果美国形成AGI霸权，我们应该怎么办？ veneer Service as Software TCPMF HBM\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-11-10-zhangxiaojun-第一个做出agi的必然是垄断者-中国只能走生态这条路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgd2vGQ01c_5mCG9B8zdbQON2o1t.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:39:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>第一个做出AGI的必然是垄断者，中国只能走生态这条路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">追求第一个碾压对手的AGI，本质是商业霸权野心——他会用这个大脑发明手段维持垄断。中国公司打不过这场烧钱游戏，只能先把推理成本降下来，用生态当护城河。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI霸权</span><span class=\"tag\">推理成本</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"80. 和知乎周源聊，社会化编辑部、孤独的悖论、AI与宿命 PMF LTV NPC Perplexity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-10-31-zhangxiaojun-知乎的敌人不是抖音-是规模驱动的自己/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/efc635d64ccaa69d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>知乎的敌人不是抖音，是规模驱动的自己</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">周源复盘：上市后视频、短内容两次战略回撤，根因是把社区当规模生意做；社区只能生态驱动，溢出式增长，不能扩列式增长。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">内容社区</span><span class=\"tag\">AI搜索</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"79. 特斯拉股价跌了，Uber却涨了？漫谈特斯拉Robotaxi大会 BOM CP / car partner Remote Assist option value 摇操作\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-10-13-zhangxiaojun-特斯拉发布会像年会-robotaxi-的故事讲给股东听/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d92f23bc8afbb6e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">58:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>特斯拉发布会像年会：Robotaxi 的故事讲给股东听</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这场发布会没有讲任何技术，更像给老股东开的年会。真正值钱的是它把车闲置时间变现的两条路：当 Robotaxi，或当分布式算力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">Robotaxi</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"78. 从蒸汽机到无人驾驶5｜谈谈自动驾驶创投过山车这8年 SPAC PS ratio Gartner 曲线\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-10-08-zhangxiaojun-自动驾驶创投八年-起步估值太高的公司几乎都死了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/26c9d4bb25a4059d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>自动驾驶创投八年：起步估值太高的公司几乎都死了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">梦醒统计过，估值一亿美金以上的非资源型前沿科技公司，好像还没有很成功的案例。起步太高的公司会把钱花在维持卖相上，而不是猥琐发育。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">风险投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"77. 并购重组会兴起吗？和陆复斌聊他隐蔽做全球并购这5年 Two-Pizza Teams LBO CIFIUS AUM skin in the game\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-10-05-zhangxiaojun-他出价51亿买雅虎-输给了45亿的对手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvgzF3dQz6pUuu7lmxDU7SYkR_C0.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:34:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>他出价51亿买雅虎，输给了45亿的对手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">陆复斌的offer比Apollo高6亿美金，却连一个答案都没拿到。五年后对方当面告诉他：你没有他们的高尔夫俱乐部会员。并购市场里，价格之外还有一层看不见的门槛。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">并购</span><span class=\"tag\">出海</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"76. 王小川返场谈o1与强化学习：摸到了一条从快思考走向慢思考的路 CoT reward model DIKW Self Play RL scaling law\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-09-25-zhangxiaojun-o1-不是转弯是进阶-快思考模型学会了慢思考/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/513984cf6692fc8c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">39:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>o1 不是转弯是进阶：快思考模型学会了慢思考</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">王小川认为 o1 是范式升级而非进步退两步——先有快思考，才能用强化学习让它学会慢思考，这条路摸到了从语言走向智能的雏形。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span><span class=\"tag\">o1</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"75. 和OpenAI前研究员吴翼解读o1：吹响了开挖第二座金矿的号角 PPO DQN RLHF self-play Scaling Law\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-09-18-zhangxiaojun-o1-不是路线转弯-是-agi-梯子又多了几节/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/671dcf2cd1d9802c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>o1 不是路线转弯，是 AGI 梯子又多了几节</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">预训练这座金矿快挖到头了，强化学习是第二座矿。o1 的 preview 更像 GPT-3 时刻，能不能成为 ChatGPT 时刻要看正式版。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span><span class=\"tag\">o1</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"74. 从蒸汽机到无人驾驶4｜Waymo和它的对手们：我暗中考察了四个月 DARPA Grand Challenge AlexNet 端到端 Moon Shot Project Robotaxi\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-09-11-zhangxiaojun-waymo-领先不是技术最强-是没犯过大错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e35749cd8b4f7e70-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>Waymo 领先不是技术最强，是没犯过大错</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Waymo 起步最早、换过四任负责人、被业内一致看衰，最后却成了 L4 唯一还在引领行业的公司——因为它活了下来，且没犯 Cruise 和 Uber 那种致命错误。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">Waymo</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"73. AGI范式大转移：和广密预言草莓、OpenAI o1和self-play RL｜全球大模型季报4 Self-Play RL Scaling Law reward model RLHF MOE DiT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-09-05-zhangxiaojun-不做强化学习的公司-下一波浪潮里可能跑不出来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/27f4c2e89ae9ca7b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>不做强化学习的公司，下一波浪潮里可能跑不出来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">语言预训练遇到瓶颈后，硅谷最核心的几百名研究者已把资源压注到 self-play RL 上，它用推理算力换训练算力，让模型自己探索出逻辑推理能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span><span class=\"tag\">AGI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"72. 从蒸汽机到无人驾驶3｜和孟醒聊特斯拉FSD进化史 MPI / MPCI BEV + Transformer VLM Remote Assist garbage in garbage out\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-09-02-zhangxiaojun-特斯拉fsd只是辅助驾驶的gpt-3时刻-不是l4/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlUGppFTCiD6i4x1NEFWXtpkFo2M.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>特斯拉FSD只是辅助驾驶的GPT-3时刻，不是L4</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">端到端让FSD一年内连升数版，但45分钟接管一次和Waymo的10万公里一次关键接管差约1000倍。L2要的是最优接管率，不是越低越好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">特斯拉FSD</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"71. 和楼天城聊聊Robotaxi和ACRush：“L2做得越厉害，离L4越远” contest based metric system MPX Hold hard end-to-end BEV Robotaxi\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-08-16-zhangxiaojun-l2做得越好离l4越远-无人驾驶的路线之争/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d093a1c7aa808aa9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>L2做得越好离L4越远，无人驾驶的路线之争</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小马智行楼天城认为 L2 和 L4 目标不同：L2 用户只要够用、成本更低，做得越好反而离 L4 越远；L4 要的是万小时不出事，还得有一把评价好坏的尺子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">Robotaxi</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"70. 和何小鹏聊，FSD、“在血海游泳”、乱世中的英雄与狗熊 AD BOM Robot Taxi OTA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-07-16-zhangxiaojun-何小鹏-大模型对小型公司不利-越强越多数据越多费用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/514c23c30b63a46b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0716</span></div>\n<h2>何小鹏：大模型对小型公司不利，越强越多数据越多费用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大 AI 的网络效应是：越强所以越多数据，越多数据所以越多费用，越多费用所以要卖越多车去支持这个体系。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"69. 口述全球大模型这半年：Perplexity突然火爆和尚未爆发的AI应用生态 PMF RAG MOE Scaling Law Latency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-06-23-zhangxiaojun-ai应用没爆发-不是产品问题是模型问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88869a8f5db7fb1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0623</span></div>\n<h2>AI应用没爆发，不是产品问题是模型问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">GPT-4 出来一年多，硅谷主流 VC 投出的 AI 应用只有 Perplexity 一家跑到 2000 多万月活；90% 的原因是只基于 GPT-4 的能力不够，只能做信息组合，做不了长距离推理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 应用</span><span class=\"tag\">Perplexity</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"68. 和MiniMax天使投资人聊，MiniMax幕后故事和大模型资本扑克牌 Club Deal corner cases MOE scale up L4\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-06-10-zhangxiaojun-minimax-第一位投资人-大厂降价是看牌-创业公司只能认赔/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6400a25bba631a90-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0610</span></div>\n<h2>MiniMax 第一位投资人：大厂降价是看牌，创业公司只能认赔</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大厂做模型可以不赚钱、从云计算把钱挣回来，创业公司被拖进价格战却无处回血；MiniMax 的解法是模型质量第一，靠海外 2C 产品收钱。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"67. 谈谈黄仁勋搭建的组织系统：分布式操作系统，“就像一台GPU” Conway&#x27;s Law context, not control Zero Billion Dollar Market chiplet\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-05-31-zhangxiaojun-英伟达没有五年计划-黄仁勋把公司做成了一台-gpu/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f0eed2af727e6cd8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0531</span></div>\n<h2>英伟达没有五年计划：黄仁勋把公司做成了一台 GPU</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黄仁勋的八条反常识管理法不是散点，而是一套分布式操作系统：60 个高管直接汇报、薪酬精确到一美分相同、不做一对一、不做计划——组织沟通结构决定了产品架构。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">组织管理</span><span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"66. 和李志飞聊IPO、GPT-4o和你不知道的前沿科技创业的痛 VLA DiT In Context Learning codec P&amp;L\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-05-23-zhangxiaojun-前沿科技创业的痛-上市那天-我觉得对不起这12年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b6a457f38ae1bd4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0523</span></div>\n<h2>前沿科技创业的痛：上市那天，我觉得对不起这12年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">出门问问创始人李志飞说，敲钟那一刻他想的不是荣耀，而是「今天这个结果对得起我12年受的磨难吗——对不起」。他把前沿科技创业的宿命总结成一块随时会化的浮冰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">前沿科技创业</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"65. 风险投资的钥匙失灵了吗？和梦秋聊：蛰伏、更少人的游戏和啮齿动物 明股实债 check size power law foundation model AI for science AI for coding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-04-22-zhangxiaojun-vc-的以小博大逻辑失效了-我们改做侏罗纪的老鼠/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d3a24508c632217d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0422</span></div>\n<h2>VC 的以小博大逻辑失效了，我们改做侏罗纪的老鼠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美元 VC 的募资端和退出端同时被掐断，靠十个 check 里中两三个的杠杆故事讲不下去了。清流资本的选择是：要么投一两年就能变现的现在学，要么投七到十年的未来学，中间地带最难。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">风险投资</span><span class=\"tag\">AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"64. 和广密聊AGI大基建时代：电+芯片=产出智能 Scaling Law Agent 主权 AI T5T Killer App\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-04-17-zhangxiaojun-agi-是马拉松-物理硬件成了最大瓶颈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9219795544d999cf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0417</span></div>\n<h2>AGI 是马拉松：物理硬件成了最大瓶颈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">去年以为加 GPU 加数据就能到 AGI，今年发现单数据中心加到 3.2 万卡就撞墙，美国能源基建还是四五十年前规划的——AGI 时间表被物理世界拖长了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>"]